FetchText extends local-ai-packaged with the following original components:

  - Document Processor (document-processor/)
      FastAPI service for document ingestion, OCR, and structured data
      extraction using Docling and LLM-based entity extraction.

  - LocalAI Admin Dashboard (localai-admin-dashboard/)
      React/TypeScript application providing the FetchText user interface,
      smart template system, and integration management.

  - Smart Template system, integration registry, vault service, and
    related infrastructure under document-processor/app/services/.

This product also includes or depends on third-party software. See the
respective package manifests (requirements.txt, pyproject.toml,
